<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 9.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 9.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 2815.06, 11.14 points or 0.39 percent lower than Friday's close.</p>
